📇 Contact Management System
📌 Description

A Contact Management System is a simple and efficient application designed to help users store, organize, search, update, and manage contact information in one place. The application provides an easy way to maintain details such as name, phone number, email address, and other personal or professional information.

It is designed with a user-friendly interface so that contacts can be added and managed quickly. The project can be useful as a beginner-friendly application for learning CRUD operations, data management, user interfaces, and search functionality.

✨ Features
👤 Add New Contacts – Easily create and save new contact records.
📝 Edit Contacts – Update existing contact information whenever required.
🗑️ Delete Contacts – Remove unwanted or outdated contacts.
🔍 Search Contacts – Quickly find a contact using their name, phone number, or other available details.
📋 View Contact List – Display all saved contacts in an organized format.
📞 Phone Number Management – Store and manage contact phone numbers.
📧 Email Management – Save and manage email addresses associated with contacts.
🏷️ Contact Categories – Organize contacts into categories such as friends, family, classmates, or work.
🔤 Sorting – Arrange contacts alphabetically or according to selected information.
💾 Data Storage – Store contact information so it can be accessed and managed later.
🔄 CRUD Operations – Supports Create, Read, Update, and Delete operations.
🧹 Clear Form – Easily reset input fields while adding or editing contacts.
📱 Responsive Interface – Can be designed to work across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.
🎨 Clean UI – Simple and organized interface for easy contact management.
⚡ Fast Access – Makes searching and managing a large number of contacts convenient.
🔐 Data Organization – Keeps contact information structured and easy to access.
🚀 Expandable Project – Can be extended with features such as login, profile pictures, cloud storage, import/export, and backup.
🔥 GitHub Description

A user-friendly Contact Management System for adding, viewing, searching, editing, and deleting contacts. The application provides organized contact storage with CRUD operations, search functionality, categorization, and a clean responsive interface.
